---
description: Finish a task clean
alwaysApply: true
---

Before finishing a task, run lint, typecheck, and unit tests when the change can affect them.

Before finishing any change to a public-facing route (`app/(home)`, `app/(shop)`, `components/site-header.tsx`, shared shop components, `app/globals.css`), always execute the release gate in `.agents/skills/website-release-gate/SKILL.md`: production build plus the Playwright audit across 375x812, 768x1024, and 1440x900 on every public route.

Do not leave placeholder copy, lorem ipsum, or invented facts on a published page.

Do not print secrets, database URLs, or tokens.
